# Each Narcomoeba milled from its owner's library triggers, and its controller may accept or decline (CR 603.2, 603.6c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Thought Scour
Island x5
Narcomoeba
Narcomoeba
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot1)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Decline

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Narcomoeba.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Narcomoeba.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour; Narcomoeba
